      "page": 344,
      "ruku": 296,
      "hizbQuarter": 137,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2703,
      "text": "Indeed, there are signs in this, and We always put people to the test.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 344,
      "ruku": 296,
      "hizbQuarter": 137,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2704,
      "text": "Then We raised up after them another generation[9],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 344,
      "ruku": 296,
      "hizbQuarter": 137,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2705,
      "text": "and We sent to them a messenger[10] from among themselves [saying], “Worship Allah; you have no god other than Him. Will you not then fear Him?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 344,
      "ruku": 296,
      "hizbQuarter": 137,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2706,
      "text": "But the chiefs of his people who disbelieved and denied the meeting of the Hereafter, and whom We had made affluent in the life of this world, said, “He is no more than a man like yourselves; he eats what you eat and drinks what you drink.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 344,
      "ruku": 297,
      "hizbQuarter": 137,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2707,
      "text": "If you obey a man like yourselves, you will surely be losers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 344,
      "ruku": 297,
      "hizbQuarter": 137,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2708,
      "text": "Does he promise you that when you have died and become dust and bones, you will be brought forth?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 344,
      "ruku": 297,
      "hizbQuarter": 137,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2709,
      "text": "Far-fetched, utterly far-fetched is what you are promised![11]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 344,
      "ruku": 297,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2710,
      "text": "There is nothing except our life in this world; we die, others are born, and none will be resurrected.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 344,
      "ruku": 297,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2711,
      "text": "He is no more than a man who has fabricated lies about Allah, and we will never believe in him.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 344,
      "ruku": 297,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2712,
      "text": "Noah said, “My Lord, help me for they have rejected me.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 344,
      "ruku": 297,
      "hizbQuarter": 138,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2713,
      "text": "Allah said, “In a little while they will surely be regretful.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
